xfs: remove the xfs_iext_peek_prev_extent call in xfs_bmapi_allocate

jira KERNEL-1630
Rebuild_History Non-Buildable kernel-4.18.0-553.166.1.el8_10
commit-author Christoph Hellwig <hch@lst.de>
commit a8bb258f703f42c322638022afa16808ca4a7d25
Empty-Commit: Cherry-Pick Conflicts during history rebuild.
Will be included in final tarball splat. Ref for failed cherry-pick at:
ciq/ciq_backports/kernel-4.18.0-553.166.1.el8_10/a8bb258f.failed

Both callers of xfs_bmapi_allocate already initialize bma->prev, don't
redo that in xfs_bmapi_allocate.

